      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This message is seriously old are they ever resolved in any way? For instance I'm updating the user count as part of OnPlayerLeft using GetPlayerCount and that reports properly. Might the list of players still be wrong? Is there a property of the player object that indicates they are in the process of leaving?",
